  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">아이들한테&nbsp;수업활동을&nbsp;너희가&nbsp;짜보자!&nbsp;선생님이&nbsp;적극&nbsp;아이디어&nbsp;반영해줄께~&nbsp;라고&nbsp;글을&nbsp;올렸더니&nbsp;한&nbsp;아이가&nbsp;보물찾기&nbsp;아이디어를&nbsp;냈습니다.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">아이디어&nbsp;설명을&nbsp;글로&nbsp;보고&nbsp;정확히&nbsp;어떻게&nbsp;하는&nbsp;건지는&nbsp;모르겠는데,&nbsp;일</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">단&nbsp;해보자&nbsp;싶어&nbsp;1:1채팅을&nbsp;하며&nbsp;'수업협의'를&nbsp;했습니다.&nbsp;이럴까요?&nbsp;저럴까요?&nbsp;하는&nbsp;아이에게&nbsp;제가&nbsp;해준&nbsp;말은&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\"니가&nbsp;알아서&nbsp;해봐~\",&nbsp;\"&nbsp;니가&nbsp;대충&nbsp;만들어&nbsp;와~\"&nbsp;였구요^^</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">저녁에&nbsp;주고받은&nbsp;채팅&nbsp;후에&nbsp;그&nbsp;반의&nbsp;해당&nbsp;수업이&nbsp;바로&nbsp;다음&nbsp;날&nbsp;3교시!&nbsp;그런데&nbsp;그&nbsp;날은&nbsp;아들&nbsp;학예회라&nbsp;11시출근으로&nbsp;지참을&nbsp;달아놓은&nbsp;날!</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\"선생님&nbsp;내일&nbsp;수업&nbsp;시작할&nbsp;때쯤&nbsp;학교&nbsp;가게&nbsp;되니까&nbsp;그&nbsp;전에&nbsp;버저샘한테&nbsp;말씀드리고&nbsp;니가&nbsp;세팅해놔~\"&nbsp;라고&nbsp;했습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">수업&nbsp;든&nbsp;날&nbsp;과학실에&nbsp;가니,&nbsp;칠판에는&nbsp;학습목표가&nbsp;빈&nbsp;칸&nbsp;상태로&nbsp;있고,&nbsp;그&nbsp;외에는&nbsp;뭐가&nbsp;어디&nbsp;있는&nbsp;지&nbsp;알&nbsp;수&nbsp;없더군요.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학습목표&nbsp;빈&nbsp;칸에&nbsp;들어갈&nbsp;글자&nbsp;하나&nbsp;하나를&nbsp;잘&nbsp;숨겨놓은&nbsp;겁니다.&nbsp;꽝도&nbsp;섞어서^^&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">글자&nbsp;하나하나를&nbsp;찾아서&nbsp;뜯지&nbsp;않고&nbsp;보고만&nbsp;와서&nbsp;조원들이&nbsp;모여&nbsp;단어를&nbsp;조합해&nbsp;최종문장을&nbsp;완성,&nbsp;글자&nbsp;하나당&nbsp;1점처리.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(디딤수업(거꾸로&nbsp;동영상)에서&nbsp;'열에너지'를&nbsp;'열&nbsp;E'로&nbsp;표현하겠다고&nbsp;한&nbsp;부분&nbsp;덕분에,&nbsp;자기&nbsp;지식만&nbsp;믿고&nbsp;다&nbsp;아는&nbsp;내용이라&nbsp;안&nbsp;찾고도&nbsp;가능하다던&nbsp;아이가&nbsp;있던&nbsp;조는&nbsp;1등을&nbsp;못&nbsp;했습니다&nbsp;ㅋ)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">과학실에서&nbsp;보물찾기가&nbsp;가능할&nbsp;줄&nbsp;몰랐는데!&nbsp;와우!!</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">애들&nbsp;완전&nbsp;신나서&nbsp;찾으러&nbsp;다녔고,&nbsp;생각보다&nbsp;소란스럽지는&nbsp;않았습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">전문지식이&nbsp;동원된&nbsp;건&nbsp;아니지만,&nbsp;교육소비자에서&nbsp;교육생산자로&nbsp;한&nbsp;발짝&nbsp;다가선&nbsp;모습이&nbsp;감동이었습니다.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ps.&nbsp;저&nbsp;활동&nbsp;덕에&nbsp;2시간&nbsp;걸려&nbsp;준비해뒀던&nbsp;기사취재수업용&nbsp;기사들은&nbsp;폐기처분되었다는..ㅜㅜ</span><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/225D953A547295712E\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"476\" width=\"476\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141124_031722_00.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_225D953A547295712ECDDF\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/275D553A5472957131\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141124_031723_01.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_275D553A5472957131CD6D\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/225B873A5472957130\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141124_031723_02.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_225B873A54729571306FEE\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/265DE23A547295722F\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141124_031723_03.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_265DE23A547295722F3A19\"/></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
